          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Like many humans raised in a close-knit community, you have always been strongly attuned to the presence of others. Willing allies that you are aware of within 60 feet that would otherwise be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Undetected] by you are instead @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] from you. The flat check for you to target willing allies within 60 feet that are hidden from you is @Check[flat|showDC:all|dc:5] instead of 11.</p>"
